<% content_for :reason, "You're getting this because you have open leads. The time it comes, or whether it does, is in Settings > Plugins > Leads." %>
Your leads this morning
<% if @due.any? %>

To do today:
<% @due.each do |step| %>
- <%= step.lead.display_name %>: <%= step.title %><% if step.overdue? %> (was due <%= step.due_on.strftime("%b %-d") %>)<% end %>
  <%= lead_url(step.lead) %>
<% end %>
<% end %>
<% if @cold.any? %>

Going cold (nobody's been in touch for a while):
<% @cold.each do |lead| %>
- <%= lead.display_name %>, last touched <%= time_ago_in_words(lead.last_touch_at) %> ago
  <%= lead_url(lead) %>
<% end %>
<% end %>
<% if @nobody.any? %>

Nobody has these yet:
<% @nobody.each do |lead| %>
- <%= lead.display_name %>
  <%= lead_url(lead) %>
<% end %>
<% end %>

<%= @url %>
